        {
            "title": "Patch changelog 28 August 2012",
            "date": "2021-08-28 07:13:47",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/4018887653987141895",
            "content": "[h1][b]Changelog[/b][/h1]\n\n- Fixed menu UI to support DLC\n- Added large screen mode (1200 x 900).\n\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/30951208/3d15244f26c661e2c43e191a548815fc026f47b3.png[/img]\nOriginal 800 x 600 screen\n\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/30951208/a3720f63f22be7a40e81a355ded63eae8449e0d3.png[/img]\nNew 1200 x 900 screen\n\nThis can be adjusted from the new options on the options page.\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/30951208/8ae6632fd2e28d55424e7a4ef65154255eed8d08.png[/img]\n\n- Added information telling which file the last save was. and add save timestamp.\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/30951208/422f615c3138972983bf6636f968b7925de352e6.png[/img]\n\n- Added two new menu page animations (requires openGL3 support to see)\n- Added some animations in some CGs and characters."
        },
